OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABeatles venue may not play live music  
OL,4,Aon rooftop                             
OL,6,FThe Grade II* listed building was the  
OL,7,Fband's headquarters between 1968 and   
OL,8,F1972. It was also the site of their    
OL,9,Fimpromptu 42-minute rooftop concert in 
OL,10,FJanuary 1969.                          
OL,12,FWestminster City councillors will vote 
OL,13,Fthe plans on Tuesday.                  
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2 
